# L §5.5 Fan-out (tally 2.1.7 R8, issue #147; #122b, F10): a leg's amount is read inside its combination: charge
# takes kasa (claims, the sign rule's place) below zero under pa = lo only, so flows(charge) reads pa through the
# walk and fans out, refused under lo and 10.00 DUK under hi, each with its own register. 2.1.6's refcore printed
# one unfanned 10.00 DUK, the guard's refusal swallowed. (T's G7 pr1.)
=== pr1.tally
model pr
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "made up"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

axis pa
  lo "lower pay"
  hi "higher pay"

place kasa: claims DUK lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input p_lo: money DUK

input p_hi: money DUK

input d1: date

input d2: date

input fee: money DUK

def pay: money DUK at d1
  rule base = p_lo
  rule hi beats base = p_hi when pa == hi

move salary: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to kasa amount pay

move charge: transfers
  on d2
  leg cash from kasa to world amount fee

ask q_fc: flows(charge, 2026-03-02) law 2026-10-25

ask q_fc_lo: flows(charge, 2026-03-02) with pa = lo law 2026-10-25

ask q_fc_hi: flows(charge, 2026-03-02) with pa = hi law 2026-10-25

ask q_bal: bal(kasa, 2026-12-31) law 2026-10-25

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  p_lo = 5.00
  p_hi = 20.00
  d1 = 2026-03-01
  d2 = 2026-03-02
  fee = 10.00
=== expect
q_bal [pa = lo]: refused: RUN-PLACE kasa is -5.00 DUK after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-02
  reading: pa = lo
  unfulfilled: salary
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
q_bal [pa = hi]: 10.00 DUK
  reading: pa = hi
  unfulfilled: charge
  unfulfilled: salary
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
q_fc [pa = lo]: refused: RUN-PLACE kasa is -5.00 DUK after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-02
  reading: pa = lo
  unfulfilled: charge
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
q_fc [pa = hi]: 10.00 DUK
  reading: pa = hi
  unfulfilled: charge
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
q_fc_hi: 10.00 DUK
  pinned: pa = hi
  unfulfilled: charge
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
q_fc_lo: refused: RUN-PLACE kasa is -5.00 DUK after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-02
  pinned: pa = lo
  unfulfilled: charge
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
